---
name: Portfolio direction
description: Cinematic visual and interaction rules for Srihari Beesetti's portfolio
type: design
---
The attached central-character portfolio composition is the primary visual reference. Use black/white-dominant Film Stock colors (#E8E6E0, #171717, #B52228, #CAB66D), Bebas Neue headings, Barlow body, and handwritten notes. S0 Animation is only a motion reference: continuously evolving project states, smooth depth transitions, kinetic typography, parallax, and connected scroll choreography. Never copy S0's branding, assets, or layout.
